# Molten Man, Inferno Incarnate is 0/0 until he controls a Mountain, so with none he dies as soon as he enters, before his enters trigger
# resolves (CR 704.5f). The ruling: the leaves-the-battlefield trigger then resolves first, and Bot1 sacrifices a land before searching. Their
# only land is the Swamp, which goes; the search then still puts the Mountain onto the battlefield tapped, and it stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Molten Man, Inferno Incarnate
Forest x5
Mountain
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Molten Man, Inferno Incarnate.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp; Molten Man, Inferno Incarnate; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = true
